1}+1=0\n$$\n\nFirst, we isolate the term with the variable exponent by subtracting $1$ from both sides:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}3{e}^{x+1}+1 & =0 \\\\ 3{e}^{x+1}+\\cancel{1}-\\cancel{1} & =0-1 \\\\ 3{e}^{x+1} & =-1\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nDividing both sides of the last equation by $3,$ we get the following:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}3{e}^{x+1} & =-1 \\\\ {e}^{x+1} & =-\\frac{1}{3}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThis equation does not have any solutions since its left-hand side is always nonnegative, while the right-hand side is negative.\n\nTherefore, $f(x)$ has no roots." 13194139534412 true] [17592186286921 1000 #edb/ref 17592186286922 13194139534412 true] [17592186286921 1000 #edb/ref 17592186286923 13194139534412 true] [17592186286921 1000 #edb/ref 17592186286924 13194139534412 true] [17592186286921 1000 #edb/ref 17592186286925 13194139534412 true] [17592186286921 1000 #edb/ref 17592186286926 13194139534412 true] [17592186286921 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139534412 true] [17592186286921 1041 "selection" 13194139534412 true] [17592186286921 1104 #edb/ref 17592186286922 13194139534412 true] [17592186286921 1110 #uuid "18efa94c-87e6-5902-bf77-ba23f32281be" 13194139534412 true] [17592186286922 1034 "The function has no roots" 13194139534412 true] [17592186286922 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045454 13194139534412 true] [17592186286922 1111 #uuid "89a01df1-80da-5ab6-8171-5c94c697e1f9" 13194139534412 true] [17592186286923 1034 "2" 13194139534412 true] [17592186286923 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534412 true] [17592186286923 1111 #uuid "d8ad6221-1e09-5c3d-84c6-0b0af2260bb2" 13194139534412 true] [17592186286924 1034 "-3" 13194139534412 true] [17592186286924 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534412 true] [17592186286924 1111 #uuid "dafc643f-7417-520f-89e4-4500e39a39f8" 13194139534412 true] [17592186286925 1034 "0" 13194139534412 true] [17592186286925 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534412 true] [17592186286925 1111 #uuid "bf967d73-3dcc-56f3-8343-4913d42fe212" 131941395344